  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/351351/Spheres-Apocrypha-Monster-Traditions?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Banners</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Banner class feature or Warleader sphere (Heraldry), Shield sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A decorated shield you carry can act as your banner or flag, allowing you to benefit from those features without needing a free hand. Your shield only counts as your banner or flag while it gives you a shield bonus to AC.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
